pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% The same inference as a bare rup, with no cutting-planes step.  Expected to
% fail: none of the three bounds pins an individual bit, so unit propagation
% never reaches the constraint row.
rup x1ge3 ~x3ge5 ==> 1 ~x2ge2 >= 1 ;
output NONE;
conclusion NONE;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
